                                "sense_id": "edfde69e-8c19-38ab-b834-4e752fd48a6b",
                                "text": "Only the elite of the party are here assembled; for it would be little short of sacrelige for a Totty or a Caffre to presume to enter these sacred precincts, or to join in the conversation of the master"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb0de2ea-cd7c-457c-b1a6-1e673f7d6c6b",
